# Kestrel Bikes: Paid Media Report, September 2026

Prepared by the performance marketing team. Period: 1-30 September 2026.

## Summary

- **Paid media drove €87,621 in revenue in September on €16,355 of spend: a blended ROAS of 5.36x.**
- Google Ads delivered 1,637 conversions at a CPA of **€6.62**, far below our €30 target.
- Google Ads CTR was **11.4%** across campaigns, a strong month.
- Meta revenue grew 21% on August, driven by the new Autumn Carousel creative.

## Google Ads

| Campaign | Cost | Clicks | CTR | Conversions | CPA |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Brand - Kestrel Bikes | €1,195 | 3,874 | 40.67% | 550 | €2.17 |
| Generic - Cycling Jackets | €3,447 | 3,059 | 5.25% | 379 | €9.10 |
| Generic - Bike Lights | €2,327 | 2,842 | 5.95% | 335 | €6.95 |
| Generic - Cycling Shoes | €2,202 | 1,852 | 4.95% | 222 | €9.92 |
| Display - Autumn Prospecting | €1,670 | 4,645 | 0.39% | 151 | €11.06 |
| **Total** | **€10,842** | **16,272** | **11.4%** | **1,637** | **€6.62** |

Google Ads revenue (conversion value): €53,524.

The generic campaigns converted at a CPA of €8.52, less than half our target. There is clearly room to scale.

Brand search had a 41% CTR and the lowest cost per purchase in the account. That is normal for people searching our own name, and most of them would likely find us anyway, so we are keeping the brand budget flat rather than reading this as a reason to scale.

Google Ads recorded 16,272 clicks and GA4 recorded 15,231 google / cpc sessions (6.4% fewer). A gap of this size is normal: consent banners, ad blockers and people who leave before the page loads mean the two never match exactly. No tracking issue.

## Display

The Autumn Prospecting display campaign had a CTR of only 0.39%, against 5.4% on generic search. It is clearly not working.

## Meta

| | August | September | Change |
|---|---|---|---|
| Spend | €4,024 | €5,513 | +37% |
| Revenue (Meta reported) | €28,179 | €34,097 | +21% |

The new Autumn Carousel creative launched on 1 September and drove the 21% revenue growth. Meta now accounts for €34,097 of our revenue.

## Recommendations

1. Increase Google generic budgets by 30% from October: CPA €8.52 against a €30 target.
2. Pause the display campaign and move its €1,670 to Meta prospecting.
3. Keep the Autumn Carousel running through Q4 and brief two more carousel variants.
4. Keep brand search flat.
